1
00:00:01,030 --> 00:00:02,853
Automatic weapon detection.

2
00:00:03,980 --> 00:00:04,956
Two profiles.

3
00:00:04,976 --> 00:00:06,794
Each with its own anti-recoil.

4
00:00:08,980 --> 00:00:11,076
First, you need a DualSense controller,

5
00:00:11,096 --> 00:00:12,810
the one with adaptive triggers.

6
00:00:12,830 --> 00:00:15,041
Then turn adaptive trigger effects on,

7
00:00:15,061 --> 00:00:15,948
in the game.

8
00:00:15,968 --> 00:00:18,123
It's the number one reason it doesn't work.

9
00:00:18,580 --> 00:00:19,617
Now, turn it on.

10
00:00:19,637 --> 00:00:21,742
Hold L2, then release Options.

11
00:00:23,280 --> 00:00:26,791
Go to the Combat category, and find the Weapon Detect row.

12
00:00:27,580 --> 00:00:28,927
Make sure it's enabled.

13
00:00:28,955 --> 00:00:30,933
Press right on the D-pad if it isn't.

14
00:00:31,580 --> 00:00:32,239
Press Cross.

15
00:00:32,239 --> 00:00:35,642
Set Device to PS5, and Type to Per Profile.

16
00:00:36,680 --> 00:00:37,839
Press Circle to leave.

17
00:00:37,859 --> 00:00:38,616
You'll see saved.

18
00:00:38,616 --> 00:00:39,418
That's it.

19
00:00:42,010 --> 00:00:44,578
Every weapon has its own trigger signature.

20
00:00:44,710 --> 00:00:47,622
Fire once, and the right profile switches on its own.

21
00:00:49,580 --> 00:00:51,929
Rarely, two weapons share one signature,

22
00:00:51,949 --> 00:00:53,760
and the screen shows a question mark.

23
00:00:53,780 --> 00:00:56,712
Hold L2, Circle and Down, pick the weapon you're holding,

24
00:00:56,712 --> 00:00:57,717
and confirm.

25
00:00:57,737 --> 00:00:58,895
It remembers.

26
00:01:00,480 --> 00:01:01,401
Wrong profile?

27
00:01:01,421 --> 00:01:02,810
One gesture fixes it.

28
00:01:02,830 --> 00:01:05,050
L2 plus left restores Primary.

29
00:01:05,070 --> 00:01:07,140
Hold it longer to wipe and re-learn.

30
00:01:07,160 --> 00:01:09,222
Right does the same for Secondary.

31
00:01:12,150 --> 00:01:14,040
Every weapon change is detected,

32
00:01:14,060 --> 00:01:15,463
matched, and applied.

33
00:01:15,550 --> 00:01:17,082
No manual switching.

34
00:01:18,550 --> 00:01:22,422
The full step-by-step setup guide is on rocketmod.org.

35
00:01:24,050 --> 00:01:24,950
Set it once.

36
00:01:24,970 --> 00:01:25,560
Play.

37
00:01:25,580 --> 00:01:26,280
Switch.

38
00:01:26,300 --> 00:01:27,150
Detected.

39
00:01:27,170 --> 00:01:28,150
RocketMod.

40
00:01:28,170 --> 00:01:29,993
Automatic weapon detection.
